{"title":"Colorful Surf","link":"https://kottke.org/25/09/colorful-surf","date":1757515179000,"content":"\n        <p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-01.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-01.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-01.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"853\" alt=\"photo of surfers in waves, with a reddish hue\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-02.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-02.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-02.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"851\" alt=\"photo of the sun glinting off of the ocean, with a red stripe at the top\" /></p>\n\n<p><img src=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-03.jpg\" srcset=\"/cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=500,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-03.jpg 500w, /cdn-cgi/image/format=auto,fit=scale-down,width=1200,metadata=none/plus/misc/images/todd-weaver-03.jpg 1200w\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1300\" height=\"867\" alt=\"surfer riding a wave, with several bands of different colors overlaid on the image\" /></p>\n\n<p>Todd Weaver uses analog &amp; in-camera experimental techniques to achieve subtly geometric and colorful <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/artanddesign/gallery/2025/sep/04/california-sun-surf-in-pictures-todd-weaver-fade-to-west\">surfing photographs</a>. Of one of his photos, Weaver says:</p>\n\n<blockquote><p>This one was taken on my half-frame camera at my favourite place to surf, First Point in Malibu. The colour is a one of a kind. I don’t think I could repeat it in a thousand tries. The stripe is an artefact of my pre-exposing process.</p></blockquote>\n\n<p>You can find more of Weaver’s work on <a href=\"https://www.toddweaver.com/\">his website</a> and <a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/toddweaver_/\">Instagram</a>. If you like these surf photos, you might be interested in getting a copy of <a href=\"https://www.toddweaver.com/shop/dream-weaver-journal-volume-2\">Dream Weaver Journal Volume 2</a>.</p>\n\n        \n\n         <p><strong>Tags:</strong> <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/photography\">photography</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/sports\">sports</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/surfing\">surfing</a> · <a href=\"https://kottke.org/tag/Todd%20Weaver\">Todd Weaver</a></p>\n\n         <p>💬 <a href=\"https://kottke.org/25/09/colorful-surf\">Join the discussion on kottke.org</a> →</p>\n\n    ","author":"Jason Kottke","siteTitle":"Kottke","siteHash":"89a883271b4598f9b33ebe87be70d38557bcd266e68aee521a8f93622e0ab723","entryHash":"38f05abe11bb637b755d1207fd63550dd1be98ed77ecb816e5a6b7adc2dd9014","category":"Sites"}